Hi Simon you can use the ectotherm model as is - just be sure to choose the appropriate local height in the microclimate model. There is a holometabolic DEB model that is now part of the ectotherm model (see recent paper with Maino as the lead author in Current Opinions in Insect Science for an e.g.).

